# ── NEVER COMMIT: notes that assess a named student ──────────────
# This repo is PUBLIC and serves GitHub Pages. Anything committed here is
# world-readable at a stable URL, forever, and indexed. Tutor notes about a
# student — scores, effort, "what is really going on" — must not be published.
# Keep them local, or in a PRIVATE repo. See AGENTS.md.
homework/PLAN-NOTES.md
**/PLAN-NOTES.md

# ── NEVER COMMIT: copyrighted source books, and anything derived from them ──
# The three SAT textbooks in this folder are commercial books still on sale, and
# this repo is PUBLIC. They are working sources for the question-extraction
# pipeline (tools/inventory_books.py) and must never be published, nor must the
# extracted question data. Keep both here locally, or in a PRIVATE repo.
*.pdf
_extract/

# generated bytecode — the extraction scripts in tools/ are tracked, but what
# the interpreter compiles them into is machine- and version-specific noise.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# editor / OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
*.bak
*.orig
# sandbox write-test artifacts (cannot be unlinked from this environment)
.__wtest*.tmp

# dependencies — only ever installed locally to run the test suites
node_modules/
